---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Core Board with Image Upload and Utterance Prediction | OS-DPI',
  description: 'ASL core board demonstration with AI plug-in for utterance prediction. Upload images and get related comment and question predictions dynamically generated by AI.',
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Core board with image upload and utterance prediction</h1>

    <p>The purpose of this demonstration UI is to demonstrate an example of an ASL core board with an AI plug-in for utterance prediction. You can download the file here: <a href="https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24946335/grid_ex_image_utterance_prediction.zip">grid_ex_image_utterance_prediction.zip</a></p>

    <p>Step-by-step <a href="https://github.com/UNC-Project-Open-AAC/OS-DPI/wiki/How-to-interact-with-the-plugins#image-utterance-prediction">instructions</a> are available for plugging in the AI feature on your board.</p>

    <p><strong>Note:</strong> In the demo, you can switch between the developer mode and full-screen user-interface pressing the <kbd>Alt</kbd> or <kbd>Option</kbd> key followed by the <kbd>D</kbd> key.</p>

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Core word board</li>
      <li>Upload images</li>
      <li>Comments prediction for the image</li>
      <li>Questions prediction for the image</li>
      <li>Prediction data is dynamically generated by an AI plug-in and can be trained or expanded based on user needs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Demo Video</h2>
    <video
      src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3307cd2c-442e-45bb-9635-e55928670481"
      controls
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px;"
      title="Demo Video"
    ></video>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>
